  {
   "id": "g_Data a",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Data and documents",
   "x": 2090,
   "y": 760,
   "width": 770,
   "height": 626,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "html",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### app/static/index.html\n**Web UI in the browser**\n\n- pick netlist, topology, technology, corner\n- choose analyses, models, voting N\n- live status, report view",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 56,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "server",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### app/server.py\n**HTTP server, stdlib only**\n\n- parses netlist, guesses topology/technology\n- adapts the netlist to SAED 90 nm\n- writes job.json, starts the pipeline\n- status API, reaper for zombie runs",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 56,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "runsh",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### run.sh\n**Starts the UI on 127.0.0.1:8765**\n\n- loads config/env.sh and jetson.env",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 246,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "catalog",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### config/catalog.json\n**Topologies, technologies, analyses**\n\n- metrics and parameters per analysis\n- UI labels (still partly Turkish)",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 246,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "ollama",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### Jetson Orin Nano / Ollama\n**LLM server, port 11434**\n\n- models of 4B or more only\n- temp 0.2, num_ctx 8192",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 576,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "hspice",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### HSPICE X-2025.06 + SAED 90 nm\n**Circuit simulator**\n\n- runs each testbench\n- writes .lis .ms0 .mt0 .ma0",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 576,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "lic",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### University license server\n**Reached through the split-tunnel VPN**\n\n- scripts/vpn.sh (local only)\n- pipeline pre-checks the port",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 766,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "github",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### GitHub Hymnelaus1/tMAGE\n**Private repository**\n\n- tags v0.1.0 to v0.3.1\n- no Synopsys material, no secrets",
   "x": 400,
   "y": 766,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "pipeline",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### engine/pipeline.py\n**Pipeline class: the whole flow**\n\n- spec, scenario, DUT precheck\n- N candidates: stimulus, measure, HSPICE\n- script-draft fallback, sanity rules\n- 5 % cluster vote, spec checks, report",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 56,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "handoff",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### engine/handoff.py\n**Data hand-off between agents**\n\n- builds context.json\n- stage files and JSON schemas\n- builds the messages and system prompt",
   "x": 1250,
   "y": 56,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "rag",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### engine/rag.py\n**Knowledge base and script drafts**\n\n- retrieves matching kit examples\n- drafts: testbench and .meas per analysis",
   "x": 1620,
   "y": 56,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "llm",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### engine/llm.py\n**Ollama chat call**\n\n- JSON mode or schema\n- JSON parse and repair",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 246,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "sim",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### engine/sim.py\n**HSPICE runner and output reader**\n\n- parse_measure_file: failed is not a value\n- lis_problems: errors and warnings",
   "x": 1250,
   "y": 246,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "log",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### engine/log.py\n**Per-run logger**\n\n- run.log, trace.jsonl, status.json\n- full prompts and HSPICE output",
   "x": 1620,
   "y": 246,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "batch",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### engine/batch.py\n**Batch runner through the UI API**\n\n- REPS runs per circuit, --voters --agent\n- summary.json and SUMMARY.md",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 436,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "bench",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### engine/bench.py\n**Older per-agent model test**\n\n- scores each model per stage",
   "x": 1250,
   "y": 436,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "prompts",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### config/agent_prompts.json\n**Common prompt, rules and pitfalls per stage**\n\n- spec, scenario, stimulus, measure, report\n- pitfalls = observed errors and fixes",
   "x": 2120,
   "y": 56,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "stages",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### config/stages.json\n**Stage goals and output schemas**\n\n- JSON schema per stage",
   "x": 2490,
   "y": 56,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "pv",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### config/prompt_versions/\n**Old prompt sets for rollback**\n\n- v1_old, v2_manual, v3_pitfalls",
   "x": 2120,
   "y": 246,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "kin",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### knowledge/inputs/\n**Kit netlists, parameter files**\n\n- SkyWater models (Apache-2.0)\n- vendor models are git-ignored",
   "x": 2490,
   "y": 246,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "kex",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### knowledge/examples + ref_da.json\n**RAG examples and the hand reference**\n\n- DA 42.58 dB, FCO 29.7 dB, TSO 43.2 dB",
   "x": 2120,
   "y": 436,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "envf",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### config/env.sh, jetson.env\n**Local settings (not in git)**\n\n- tool paths, license server, Ollama address",
   "x": 2490,
   "y": 436,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "mbench",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### model_bench.sh\n**Each model alone on DA, FCO, TSO**\n\n- 3 runs x 3 candidates",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 816,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "mixed",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### mixed_vote.sh\n**Mixed-model voting**\n\n- one model per candidate",
   "x": 1250,
   "y": 816,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "rank",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### rank_models.py\n**Top 3 models per circuit**\n\n- clean majority, accuracy, speed",
   "x": 1620,
   "y": 816,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "recomp",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### recompute_scores.py\n**Offline re-scoring**\n\n- re-parses .ms0/.mt0, re-clusters\n- writes docs/23",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 1006,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "scan",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### scan_findings.py, scan_loop.sh\n**Read-only findings scan**\n\n- writes docs/22",
   "x": 1250,
   "y": 1006,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "collect",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### collect_logs.py\n**All run logs in one place**\n\n- writes docs/24 and the raw log archive",
   "x": 1620,
   "y": 1006,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "figs",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### make_figures.py, make_project_map.py\n**README figures and this map**\n\n- SVG, PNG, Obsidian Canvas",
   "x": 880,
   "y": 1196,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "backup",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### backup.sh, install_backup.sh\n**Automatic backup**\n\n- post-commit hook + 2-hourly timer\n- local snapshot, then push",
   "x": 1250,
   "y": 1196,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "vpn",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### vpn.sh\n**University VPN service (local only)**\n\n- always-on split tunnel",
   "x": 1620,
   "y": 1196,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "runs",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### runs/<id>/\n**One folder per run**\n\n- context.json, stages/, work/cand*\n- run.log, trace.jsonl, report.md",
   "x": 2120,
   "y": 816,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "batchd",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### batch/<name>/\n**Benchmark and mixed-vote results**\n\n- model x circuit x rep, summary.json",
   "x": 2490,
   "y": 816,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "docs",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### docs/ (Obsidian vault)\n**Notes, reports, change log**\n\n- 17 hand-off, 18 change log, 20 errors\n- 22 to 25 generated reports, session notes",
   "x": 2120,
   "y": 1006,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "snap",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### /data/tmage_backups/\n**Local snapshots and git bundles**\n\n- keeps 48",
   "x": 2490,
   "y": 1006,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "test",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### ~/tmage_teste/\n**Test and backup copy of everything**\n\n- no remote, no hook",
   "x": 2120,
   "y": 1196,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 160,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "road",
   "type": "text",
